                <invention-title lang="de">BABYTRAGE UND VERRIEGELUNGSMECHANISMUS DAFÜR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PORTE-BÉBÉ ET SON MÉCANISME DE VERROUILLAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">BABY CARRIER AND LOCKING MECHANISM THEREOF</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>What disclosed are a baby carrier and a locking mechanism (300) thereof. The locking mechanism (300) includes a locking mechanism (310) and an installing seat (320). The fixing seat (310) has a receiving hole (315) and a first locking part. The installing seat (320) has an inserting portion (322) and a second locking part connected to the inserting portion (322), and the inserting portion (322) is configured to be inserted into the receiving hole (315). The first locking part and the second locking part are configured to engage when the inserting portion (322) is inserted into the receiving hole (315).</p>
            </abstract>
